OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor formally resigns after
OL,4,Aletter blunder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA by-election has been called after a
OL,7,Fcouncillor's initial unsuccessful
OL,8,Fattempt to resign earlier this month -
OL,9,Fwhen she handed her resignation letter
OL,10,Fin to the wrong council - was followed
OL,11,Fby her confirmed resignation.
OL,13,FReform UK's Christine Duffy was elected
OL,14,Fin May to represent the Town ward on
OL,15,FNewcastle-under-Lyme Borough Council
OL,16,Fbut submitted a resignation letter to
OL,17,FKidsgrove Town Council on 4 August.
OL,19,FIn her initial resignation letter, seen
OL,20,Fby the BBC, Duffy said she had decided
OL,21,Fto step down as she had received "very
OL,22,Flittle or no training for this role".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
