OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor formally resigns after
OL,4,Aletter blunder
OL,5,
OL,6,FThen on Friday, Duffy said: "It is with
OL,7,Fdeep regret that I have formally
OL,8,Fresigned, with immediate effect."
